1. Landing Page (/)

Design a modern SaaS landing page for an AI-powered career guidance platform targeting students and young professionals. Use a clean white background with blue and purple gradients, rounded cards, subtle shadows, and premium typography.

Layout:





Sticky navbar with logo, navigation links (Features, How it Works, Pricing, About), Login button, and a primary CTA that changes based on authentication status.



Full-width hero section with large headline, supporting text, illustration of AI career analysis, and primary CTA ("Start Assessment").



Three feature cards highlighting AI Assessment, Aptitude Analysis, and Personalized Career Reports.



Three-step "How It Works" section with numbered cards: Register → Complete Assessment → Receive Career Recommendations.



Six-card feature grid showing platform capabilities.



Three customer testimonials with profile photos, ratings, and quotes.



Large CTA banner encouraging users to begin assessment.



Four-column footer containing Company, Resources, Legal, and Social links.

The page is completely static with no backend functionality.



