enhance the existing pages based on the given cohesive design system for an AI-powered career guidance platform for students and young professionals using the GNZ brand identity.The interface should feel trustworthy, premium, academic, and intelligent while remaining welcoming and easy to navigate. Support both Light Mode and Dark Mode with seamless theme switching while preserving accessibility and brand consistency. The design should combine modern SaaS aesthetics with subtle educational elements, emphasizing clarity, confidence, and personalized guidance. 



Use a modern SaaS aesthetic with rounded corners (16–24px), subtle glassmorphism, soft shadows, premium typography (Inter or Manrope), colorful illustrations, responsive layouts, and accessible spacing. Navbar appears on Landing, Assessment, Recommendations, Payment, Career Deep Dive, Profile, and Settings pages, but is intentionally hidden on Login, Signup, Career Report, and 404 pages. Maintain consistent cards, buttons, forms, icons, and animations across all screens.



Build the entire design system with complete support for Light Mode and Dark Mode, ensuring every component automatically adapts while maintaining accessibility, readability, and brand consistency.

